PLACEHOLDER — this is not a real game executable.

This plain-text file stands in for MinimalGame.exe so the example folder
has the layout X-Native's catalog expects: the manifest (game.json) names
this file, and the catalog only catalogues a manifest game when the named
executable actually exists on disk.

Replace this file with the real MinimalGame.exe to use the example for
real. Until then the catalog still lists the game: a file that is not a
valid PE image is catalogued as a Windows executable with unknown
architecture rather than being dropped.
